  fhir:StructureDefinition.description [ fhir:value "HL7® Austria FHIR® Core Profile for a related person in Austria.\r\nThe HL7® AT Core RelatedPerson is based upon the core FHIR® RelatedPeson Resource and designed to meet the applicable demographic data elements in Austria. Note, this extension represents the common structure of a person information within Austrian information systems."] ;
